OL,3,GNEWSA'Trailblazing' moment as modular
OL,4,Abridge takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pieces of a "first-of-its-kind"
OL,7,Fmodular bridge are being connected up
OL,8,Fas work continues to improve a key city
OL,9,Fartery.
OL,11,FThe new bridge is part of a redesign of
OL,12,Fthe A11/A47 Thickthorn junction, near
OL,13,FNorwich, with the sections built
OL,14,Felsewhere and transported to the site.
OL,16,FThis includes six 100-tonne beams
OL,17,Fmeasuring 38 metres long, which were
OL,18,Fbuilt in Ireland and transferred across
OL,19,Fthe Irish Sea to Liverpool, then across
OL,20,Fthe country via road to Norfolk.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
