OL,3,GNEWSA'Trailblazing' moment as modular
OL,4,Abridge takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways senior project
OL,7,Fmanager Syed Abbas described the build
OL,8,Fas a "trailblazing" moment for his
OL,9,Fteam, but drivers would face road
OL,10,Fclosures during its installation.
